# Local dev server (browser testing)

Keep the FIL dev stack available on **http://127.0.0.1:8000** while working in this repo.

## Agent duties

1. **Before browser verification** — run `./scripts/dev-serve.sh status`. If health is not ok, run `./scripts/dev-serve.sh start` (does not kill an already-healthy server).
2. **After backend PHP changes** — run `./scripts/dev-serve.sh restart` (only then stop the listener on :8000).
3. If `start` leaves health unreachable, run a **background terminal**: `cd backend && php artisan serve --host=127.0.0.1 --port=8000 --no-reload` (`block_until_ms: 0`).
4. **After frontend changes that affect the built SPA** — run `cd frontend && npm run build`, then `./scripts/dev-serve.sh restart`.
5. **Do not** leave a stale or wrong `php artisan serve` on :8000 (e.g. SQLite E2E env). Use only `./scripts/dev-serve.sh` (PostgreSQL from `backend/.env`).

## Commands (repo root)

```bash
./scripts/dev-serve.sh start    # first time / cold start
./scripts/dev-serve.sh restart  # after code or asset changes
./scripts/dev-serve.sh status   # PID + /api/health
```

Logs: `/tmp/fil-dev-serve.log`

## URLs for manual checks

Use **http://127.0.0.1:8000** (not `/app/...` — that prefix was removed). If the browser shows “can’t connect”, run `./scripts/dev-serve.sh restart`.

| Surface | URL | Demo login |
|--------|-----|------------|
| Staff SPA | http://127.0.0.1:8000/login | `admin@fil.test` / `password` |
| Prospect portal | http://127.0.0.1:8000/portal/login | `prospect@fil.test` / `password` |

If portal login says no active application: `cd backend && php artisan fil:ensure-demo-prospect`, then `restart`.

Details: `docs/LOCAL_DEV.md`
